From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seven7sas <zazad2288@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 04:01:05 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] LaggingEntityGuard, pipeline optimizations and piston,
 waypoint and leveldata fixes

- LaggingEntityGuard hooks with ThreadMXBean CPU verification and GC guard in ServerLevel and Entity

- Block/tick & entity physics pipelines: O(1) navigation/POI early-return, Alternate Current pooling + empty BlockRedstoneEvent skip, per-chunk scheduled tick cap, section fluid/inside-block/hard-collision fast paths and Cobweb/FallingBlockEntity optimizations

- Piston entity section pre-check and empty BlockPistonEvent skip, Guava-free ServerWaypointManager with block coordinate caches, cached WorldGenSettings NBT tag and async level.dat compression

